\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Schema transition example from a reduced \texttt  {cultural\_media\_001}. The left panel shows a raw JSON Schema excerpt from the task's \texttt  {target\_schema}; the right panel shows the corresponding selected-field excerpts emitted by the plain compact and reasoned Pydantic-style prompt renderers. The excerpt keeps a string-valued enum field, a nullable field, and field descriptions while omitting root metadata and unrelated fields for space.}}{6}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
